    "brand": "Ensure",
    "badge": "Best Ensure Powder",
    "category": "Protein powder with creatine and HMB",
    "description": "Abbott launched this powder in October 2026, and it is the first Ensure tub built around protein rather than general nutrition. Per Abbott, each serving gives 30 g of protein, 5 g of creatine monohydrate and 3 g of calcium HMB, with about 2 g of sugar, and one 28 oz tub makes 15 shakes mixed with 12 fl oz of liquid. Abbott says it is NSF Contents Certified. The protein source and sweeteners were not published on the brand pages we checked, so read the tub's panel before you buy.",
    "pros": [
      "30 g protein, 5 g creatine and 3 g HMB per serving (brand)",
