    "brand": "Ensure",
    "badge": "Easiest Alternative (Ready to Drink)",
    "category": "Ready-to-drink protein shake",
    "description": "Not a powder, but the product most Ensure powder shoppers end up comparing against. Per the label at the time of writing, each 11 fl oz bottle gives 30 g of protein from milk protein concentrate and calcium caseinate, about 150 calories, 1 g of sugar and 4 g of fiber, sweetened with sucralose and acesulfame potassium. It needs no scoop or shaker, which matters for anyone with arthritis or a poor appetite. A four-pack was $10.19 at Target in November 2026.",
    "pros": [
      "30 g protein and 1 g sugar per bottle (label)",
      "No mixing, no measuring",
      "About $2.10 per 25 g in a four-pack, less in bulk"
    ],
    "cons": [
